1
00:00:01,730 --> 00:00:02,990
What about Cha Dohyun?

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:04,270
What?

3
00:00:04,770 --> 00:00:06,710
I mean, is he doing well?

4
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,820
We broke up.

5
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:27,670
Ah...

6
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:32,880
It's already summer.

7
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:38,540
Why don't you take a shower at my place?

8
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:39,510
What?

9
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:45,660
Hey, Kwon Yihyun.

10
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:48,630
I'm saying this because I'm worried.

11
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:51,170
Don't talk like this
to other people.

12
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:52,640
What?

13
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:56,430
I'm saying this 'cause who knows—

14
00:00:56,910 --> 00:01:00,520
you didn't... have feelings...
for me, right?

15
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:04,530
If you think we can get together
just 'cause I broke up with him,

16
00:01:04,530 --> 00:01:06,060
it'll put me in a tight spot.

17
00:01:11,580 --> 00:01:12,450
Forget it if you're not.

18
00:01:12,450 --> 00:01:14,750
Why are you looking at me like that? Jeez.

19
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:22,730
I'm off.

20
00:01:29,970 --> 00:01:31,030
Hey, Kwon Yihyun.

21
00:01:33,810 --> 00:01:36,509
Those people at the club
won't do anything strange

22
00:01:36,509 --> 00:01:37,970
like bullying you, right?

23
00:01:40,310 --> 00:01:41,410
No.

24
00:01:45,190 --> 00:01:46,380
That's good enough.

25
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:49,150
I'm off for real.

26
00:02:26,350 --> 00:02:29,060
[Sung Inho]

27
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,600
[Kim Domin]

28
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:58,160
[Summertime]

29
00:03:07,060 --> 00:03:12,490
[3 months ago]

30
00:03:33,050 --> 00:03:34,910
[Cha Dohyun]

31
00:03:46,210 --> 00:03:48,040
Do you know where this is?

32
00:03:48,210 --> 00:03:49,670
Just go in that direction.

33
00:03:50,550 --> 00:03:51,470
Thank you.

34
00:04:32,420 --> 00:04:33,820
Cha Dohyun, I'm here.

35
00:04:34,270 --> 00:04:36,340
The drinking snacks are here!

36
00:04:44,090 --> 00:04:46,990
Oh... It's Yeo Eunho.

37
00:04:50,250 --> 00:04:51,070
Here.

38
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,220
Who's this?

39
00:04:57,790 --> 00:04:58,750
Someone you know?

40
00:04:58,750 --> 00:04:59,510
Yeah,

41
00:05:00,020 --> 00:05:02,080
he's my favorite person in the world.

42
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:05,140
What? You have someone like that?

43
00:05:07,090 --> 00:05:09,930
Hello, I'm Dohyun's friend
in the same major.

44
00:05:15,810 --> 00:05:16,920
I'll get going.

45
00:05:18,220 --> 00:05:19,510
Hey, Cha Dohyun!

46
00:05:20,470 --> 00:05:21,460
Darn it.

47
00:05:21,620 --> 00:05:23,560
You're a freshman,
don't you know your place?

48
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:28,440
How dare you leave
when your seniors are here?

49
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:32,159
Hey, come back later.

50
00:05:33,690 --> 00:05:35,490
I want to leave.

51
00:05:36,130 --> 00:05:37,710
Do I need a reason not to leave?

52
00:05:37,710 --> 00:05:39,110
What did this rascal say?

53
00:05:39,620 --> 00:05:40,420
You're drunk.

54
00:05:40,550 --> 00:05:41,470
Don't stop me!

55
00:05:41,570 --> 00:05:43,010
I'm not drunk, darn it!

56
00:05:43,060 --> 00:05:44,880
He always looks down on me.

57
00:05:45,010 --> 00:05:45,870
Feels damn ass!

58
00:05:46,100 --> 00:05:48,409
Let go of me!

59
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:50,010
What are you doing? Just go!

60
00:06:07,020 --> 00:06:09,490
Where are you? Why did you leave alone?

61
00:06:12,070 --> 00:06:14,110
What? Managed to leave?

62
00:06:14,460 --> 00:06:15,390
Yes.

63
00:06:17,090 --> 00:06:18,930
Who was that?

64
00:06:20,420 --> 00:06:21,870
The class representative.

65
00:06:21,870 --> 00:06:24,130
He went to the military
as soon as he got into college.

66
00:06:24,130 --> 00:06:25,880
It's his first semester back.

67
00:06:26,050 --> 00:06:27,460
He was probably drunk.

68
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,300
Isn't that your senior?

69
00:06:31,890 --> 00:06:33,190
Of course.

70
00:06:35,340 --> 00:06:38,210
Don't be like that.
It's not too late. Go back.

71
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,250
If you offend those old brats,

72
00:06:40,470 --> 00:06:42,280
you'll be the one to suffer.

73
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:46,159
I put the side dishes in the fridge.

74
00:06:47,150 --> 00:06:48,900
Don’t drink too much.

75
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:55,700
Eunho.
Seems like you don't miss me that much.

76
00:06:56,850 --> 00:06:57,800
What?

77
00:06:57,940 --> 00:07:00,600
You've been saying
you're busy and tired lately.

78
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:03,150
We haven't seen each other
for a long time.

79
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,410
Are you drunk?

80
00:07:09,050 --> 00:07:11,300
Is that all you can say?

81
00:07:15,590 --> 00:07:18,410
Hey. I'm just worried that
you offend your senior.

82
00:07:18,660 --> 00:07:21,150
What's more, make it clear.

83
00:07:21,410 --> 00:07:23,940
People might think
we haven't met for months.

84
00:07:24,220 --> 00:07:26,070
It's only been 4 days. Four!

85
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,850
So?

86
00:07:28,220 --> 00:07:29,720
We met 4 days ago,

87
00:07:29,850 --> 00:07:32,800
so it's fine that we don't see each other?

88
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,080
Fine.

89
00:07:34,350 --> 00:07:37,070
I'm sorry I was too busy.
Darn it, are you satisfied now?

90
00:07:37,070 --> 00:07:39,420
It's all my fault, okay?

91
00:07:39,980 --> 00:07:40,980
Bye.

92
00:07:58,570 --> 00:08:00,220
I'll get this too.

93
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:00,510
[Hangover drink]

94
00:08:01,550 --> 00:08:02,990
It's 8,700 won.

95
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:07,320
[Condom]

96
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:06,940
Excuse me,

97
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:09,680
-I'm the one here first...
-We'll get this too.

98
00:08:11,310 --> 00:08:13,280
What? Why are you here?

99
00:08:13,710 --> 00:08:15,440
'Cause you said you were sorry.

100
00:08:15,840 --> 00:08:16,910
What?

101
00:08:17,130 --> 00:08:19,100
So I came to accept your apology.

102
00:08:21,500 --> 00:08:23,160
Do you want to pay for this too?

103
00:08:24,220 --> 00:08:26,310
No, we don't know each other.

104
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,330
Hey.

105
00:08:48,570 --> 00:08:50,570
Is it fun to tease me?

106
00:08:51,030 --> 00:08:53,970
I don't like to tease you.

107
00:08:54,100 --> 00:08:55,870
I like you.

108
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:57,700
Sweet-talker.

109
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:08,800
Mom worked so hard.

110
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:13,040
Tell her we'll visit her next week.

111
00:09:13,180 --> 00:09:14,940
Aren't you her son?

112
00:09:15,070 --> 00:09:17,130
Call her yourself, you unfilial son.

113
00:09:19,830 --> 00:09:23,760
What's all this? Why did you buy so much?

114
00:09:23,940 --> 00:09:26,170
It's all for me. Don't touch it.

115
00:09:26,310 --> 00:09:28,030
I'll kill you if you eat any.

116
00:09:29,090 --> 00:09:30,090
Fine.

117
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:37,000
But...

118
00:09:37,980 --> 00:09:39,720
Can I eat something else?

119
00:09:40,250 --> 00:09:41,510
Again?

120
00:09:43,970 --> 00:09:45,120
The class representative

121
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:47,850
poured soju in a beer cup
and told me to drink it up.

122
00:09:48,270 --> 00:09:50,730
Stop it. You're sweating.

123
00:09:50,970 --> 00:09:52,370
I gave him some suggestions

124
00:09:52,370 --> 00:09:55,290
for one of our group assignments
this time, so he might be picking me

125
00:09:55,290 --> 00:09:57,040
cause I ticked him off.

126
00:09:57,290 --> 00:09:58,820
It’s so annoying, Eunho.

127
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:00,340
So what do you want me to do?

128
00:10:00,820 --> 00:10:02,250
Can you comfort me today?

129
00:10:02,990 --> 00:10:04,080
What?

130
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:06,250
Let's shower together.

131
00:10:09,130 --> 00:10:10,960
No, I'm tired.

132
00:10:11,110 --> 00:10:12,830
Then just stay still.

133
00:10:30,310 --> 00:10:31,540
Stop it.

134
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:44,380
Touch me too.

135
00:12:05,420 --> 00:12:08,030
[Forum]

136
00:12:11,220 --> 00:12:13,730
[I saw a handsome guy smoking
at the business administration building.]

137
00:12:15,870 --> 00:12:18,920
[I wanted to chat him up by asking him for fire but he gave me the lighter straight.
Seriously speaking: he wants to marry me, right?]

138
00:12:18,930 --> 00:12:22,720
[I wanted to ask for his phone number,
but he left picking up a phone call all smiles.]

139
00:12:22,730 --> 00:12:26,010
[Since he was at the business administration building, that must be his major right?
I'm going to camp there for him starting today.]

140
00:12:27,330 --> 00:12:28,390
[204 replies]

141
00:12:28,510 --> 00:12:31,100
[Anonymous 1: I'm sure he has a girlfriend.]

142
00:12:31,100 --> 00:12:34,290
[Anonymous 2: There's only one person they can be talking about
if it's business administration.]

143
00:12:34,290 --> 00:12:37,380
[Anonymous 3: I'm from another department, but I can guess who it is.
There has been so many posts like this since school started.]

144
00:12:37,380 --> 00:12:38,070
[Anonymous 4: Haha, my friend already got his number.]

145
00:12:49,970 --> 00:12:53,990
[Messages]
[Yeo Eunho: Where are you?]

146
00:12:53,990 --> 00:12:56,740
[Kim Minhyuk: Dohyon, do you wanna meet my friend?]
[Seo Taeyoung: My friend asked me for your number.]

147
00:12:56,740 --> 00:12:58,960
[Nam Soo-a: Do you want to go on a blind date?]
[Ji Soyeon: Dohyun, my friend says she's interested in you.]

148
00:13:06,490 --> 00:13:08,350
What are you going to do tomorrow?

149
00:13:09,010 --> 00:13:10,960
To help out at my parents' place.

150
00:13:11,380 --> 00:13:13,040
Then I won't see you tomorrow?

151
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:14,120
Mm.

152
00:13:14,390 --> 00:13:15,330
Why?

153
00:13:16,300 --> 00:13:17,830
Can't we meet tomorrow too?

154
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:19,430
No.

155
00:13:37,340 --> 00:13:38,420
Well,

156
00:13:39,750 --> 00:13:42,360
the girl who flirted with you
when you were smoking,

157
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:43,500
was she pretty?

158
00:13:46,570 --> 00:13:48,170
Seems like she was your type.

159
00:13:48,210 --> 00:13:49,910
You even gave her a lighter.

160
00:13:52,510 --> 00:13:53,390
Eunho.

161
00:13:53,880 --> 00:13:54,660
What?

162
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:56,560
Are you jealous?

163
00:13:58,100 --> 00:14:00,010
I was just asking.

164
00:14:02,930 --> 00:14:04,390
I'm not jealous.

165
00:14:09,920 --> 00:14:11,720
I didn't want to keep a lighter
someone else has touched,

166
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:13,250
so I gave it to her.

167
00:14:15,180 --> 00:14:17,350
How can you still not know
what my type is?

168
00:14:17,350 --> 00:14:18,240
Hmm?

169
00:14:22,500 --> 00:14:24,630
Should I tell you while washing you up?

170
00:14:25,970 --> 00:14:27,820
Just sleep, you pervert.

171
00:14:41,860 --> 00:14:42,970
Dohyun.

172
00:14:43,730 --> 00:14:44,630
Hmm?

173
00:14:47,030 --> 00:14:49,440
You're the only one I like.

174
00:14:52,060 --> 00:14:55,600
What? Are you confessing?

175
00:14:56,850 --> 00:15:01,750
You like a lot of things,
and you're very capable.

176
00:15:11,250 --> 00:15:13,100
Don't worry.

177
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:16,110
I only have you.

178
00:15:36,190 --> 00:15:37,630
Check please!

179
00:15:38,230 --> 00:15:41,000
Okay, I'll get you your check.

180
00:15:41,940 --> 00:15:43,750
Which table is it?

181
00:15:43,910 --> 00:15:45,190
The one over there.

182
00:15:46,810 --> 00:15:47,790
Over there.

183
00:15:57,370 --> 00:15:58,570
Do you need a receipt?

184
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:00,050
The meat is burning!

185
00:16:00,430 --> 00:16:01,640
Hold on.

186
00:16:02,670 --> 00:16:03,670
Please excuse me.

187
00:16:11,220 --> 00:16:12,530
Sorry.

188
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:15,310
I'll get you a new plate of meat.

189
00:16:34,170 --> 00:16:35,090
Here's your beer.

190
00:16:35,090 --> 00:16:37,310
I wanted soju.

191
00:16:38,220 --> 00:16:41,710
I'm sorry. I'll get it right away.

192
00:17:02,660 --> 00:17:07,420
[Missed call: Cha Dohyun]

193
00:17:13,050 --> 00:17:16,579
Please leave a message after the tone.

194
00:17:16,859 --> 00:17:17,650
After...

195
00:17:28,670 --> 00:17:32,800
[Cha Dohyun: Done with my day.
Arrived at our stay!]

196
00:17:42,500 --> 00:17:43,990
Eunho, charcoal!

197
00:17:44,690 --> 00:17:47,600
Okay. Coming.

198
00:17:49,210 --> 00:17:50,210
Smells good.

199
00:17:50,380 --> 00:17:51,320
-It smells good, right?
-Yes.

200
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:52,650
Jihyun made all of them.

201
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:54,530
I just cut the vegetables.

202
00:17:54,660 --> 00:17:56,340
That's everything.

203
00:17:57,340 --> 00:17:58,270
Where's Dohyun?

204
00:17:58,430 --> 00:18:01,200
He said he'll be late
cause he has student council meeting.

205
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:02,130
Let's eat first.

206
00:18:02,140 --> 00:18:03,330
-Okay.
-All right.

207
00:18:03,630 --> 00:18:05,440
Yeo Eunho, come out!

208
00:18:10,240 --> 00:18:12,530
Is Dohyun the year representative?

209
00:18:12,910 --> 00:18:13,850
Yes.

210
00:18:14,830 --> 00:18:17,160
I heard he got a scholarship too.

211
00:18:17,650 --> 00:18:18,630
Yes.

212
00:18:18,770 --> 00:18:20,430
If you become an intern in sophomore year,

213
00:18:20,430 --> 00:18:23,430
you can go straight
to the company after you graduate.

214
00:18:23,520 --> 00:18:26,960
Dohyun has nothing to worry about.

215
00:18:28,150 --> 00:18:29,430
What about Eunho?

216
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,470
What have you been up to lately?

217
00:18:31,470 --> 00:18:34,100
He's been helping out at the store.

218
00:18:35,320 --> 00:18:38,290
You're helping your parents—
that's amazing.

219
00:18:39,550 --> 00:18:41,000
It's nothing much.

220
00:18:42,150 --> 00:18:44,260
What did you like again?

221
00:18:44,500 --> 00:18:46,700
What was your dream when you were young?

222
00:18:47,350 --> 00:18:49,220
He has to take over this shop.

223
00:18:53,270 --> 00:18:54,430
Why?

224
00:18:57,350 --> 00:18:58,280
What?

225
00:18:58,770 --> 00:19:02,050
You never asked me
if I wanted to take over.

226
00:19:02,490 --> 00:19:05,160
What are you going to do
if not that?

227
00:19:05,810 --> 00:19:07,990
Do you have other plans?

228
00:19:10,900 --> 00:19:11,730
Well,

229
00:19:11,850 --> 00:19:14,460
kids at his age
must have a lot they want to do.

230
00:19:14,570 --> 00:19:16,710
That's why he doesn't know
what he wants to do.

231
00:19:16,710 --> 00:19:19,050
You'll get used to it doing it.

232
00:19:19,180 --> 00:19:21,440
It makes you feel like this is your dream.

233
00:19:27,820 --> 00:19:29,050
Goodbye.

234
00:19:33,110 --> 00:19:34,170
Welcome...

235
00:19:37,340 --> 00:19:39,750
My son! You're here.

236
00:19:43,250 --> 00:19:45,110
These are my college classmates.

237
00:19:45,260 --> 00:19:46,660
This is my mom. Say hello.

238
00:19:46,700 --> 00:19:47,730
Hello.

239
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:49,390
Welcome.

240
00:19:50,420 --> 00:19:51,360
Eunho.

241
00:19:51,700 --> 00:19:52,940
Set up the tableware.

242
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:57,160
Oh!

243
00:19:58,060 --> 00:19:59,920
You're that deliveryman, right?

244
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:03,460
You met him in front of
the major activity room that day, right?

245
00:20:03,460 --> 00:20:05,220
He's my favorite friend.

246
00:20:13,300 --> 00:20:15,230
You've got something on your face.

247
00:20:58,640 --> 00:21:01,890
I'm sorry. Sorry.

248
00:21:09,120 --> 00:21:12,820
What? For what?

249
00:21:16,040 --> 00:21:17,860
For everything.

250
00:21:25,110 --> 00:21:26,550
Seems like you saw

251
00:21:26,700 --> 00:21:27,770
how embarrassed I was.

252
00:21:27,770 --> 00:21:29,230
Eunho, it’s not like that.

253
00:21:30,810 --> 00:21:32,310
Whether it's back in school or now,

254
00:21:32,310 --> 00:21:33,110
when I'm with you,

255
00:21:33,110 --> 00:21:34,750
I'm always the worse off one.

256
00:21:35,850 --> 00:21:37,440
It was already enough that you got me
to go to your school.

257
00:21:37,440 --> 00:21:39,370
Why do you have to come to the store?

258
00:21:40,420 --> 00:21:41,910
I'm sorry.

259
00:21:42,460 --> 00:21:44,670
This was thoughtless of me.

260
00:21:45,170 --> 00:21:47,760
I came here cause I just

261
00:21:48,040 --> 00:21:50,790
wanted to see you,
no matter what.

262
00:21:52,570 --> 00:21:54,260
You selfish jerk.

263
00:21:55,040 --> 00:21:56,740
You're always

264
00:21:56,880 --> 00:21:58,880
so selfish.

265
00:21:59,660 --> 00:22:00,300
Yeo Eunho.

266
00:22:00,390 --> 00:22:02,190
Just find someone as good as you.

267
00:22:02,330 --> 00:22:04,830
I never thought that way.

268
00:22:05,090 --> 00:22:09,120
I know you did nothing wrong.

269
00:22:10,570 --> 00:22:12,880
It's my fault.

270
00:22:25,940 --> 00:22:27,530
Let's stop here.

271
00:22:31,820 --> 00:22:33,570
What did you say?

272
00:22:42,300 --> 00:22:45,380
I said let's break up.

273
00:23:00,220 --> 00:23:06,700
[Summertime]

274
00:23:08,220 --> 00:23:10,840
I said let's break up.

275
00:23:16,470 --> 00:23:17,750
By the way, Eunho.

276
00:23:17,880 --> 00:23:19,890
A part-timer is joining tomorrow.

277
00:23:19,920 --> 00:23:20,820
A part-timer?

278
00:23:21,050 --> 00:23:22,150
Who?

279
00:23:23,150 --> 00:23:24,870
He's going to do it for just a month.

280
00:23:24,870 --> 00:23:27,730
You have to do it lightly
so it doesn't look unfresh.

281
00:23:32,640 --> 00:23:34,560
What? Not going to work?

282
00:23:34,950 --> 00:23:36,880
I have something to say, Yeo Eunho.

283
00:23:39,010 --> 00:23:41,600
Do we have anything to say to each other?

284
00:23:42,120 --> 00:23:43,110
I'm off.

285
00:23:50,650 --> 00:23:52,110
Yeo Eunho, come out.

286
00:23:53,300 --> 00:23:55,270
I'm dying from the heat, so come out.
